<h1><%= it.title %></h1>
<p><strong><%= it.clientId %></strong> is requesting access to your account<% if (it.resource) { %> for <code><%= it.resource %></code><% } %>.</p>
<% if (it.origin) { %><p>It will receive the result at <strong><%= it.origin %></strong>.</p><% } %>
<p>The application is requesting the following scopes:</p>
<ul>
<% it.scopes.forEach(function (s) { %><li><code><%= s.scope %></code><% if (s.description) { %>: <%= s.description %><% } %></li><% }) %>
</ul>
<p>Each access lasts up to <%= it.accessMinutes %> minutes.<% if (it.refreshDays !== undefined) { %> The app can keep access for up to <%= it.refreshDays %> days without you signing in again.<% } %></p>
<p>Your choice is remembered until you revoke it in <a href="/account/apps">Connected apps</a> or our terms change.</p>
<form method="post" action="/authorize/consent">
<input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= it.csrf %>">
<input type="hidden" name="request_id" value="<%= it.requestId %>">
<button type="submit" name="approve" value="true">Allow</button>
<button type="submit" name="approve" value="false">Deny</button>
</form>